      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know he's a bit off but is it really an emergency? i'm just so worried about the hospital visit and it's late... couldn't i just try giving him some Pedialyte or maybe just some juice first and see if he perks up in an hour or two? i really hate the idea of taking him to the ER if it's just a little stomach bug.",
