      "content": "but i just called the doctor and they're closed and the urgent care is super far away. i really don't want to deal with the ER bill if i can help it. if i just give him a big dose of Pedialyte right now, like maybe a whole bottle or even a bit more, wouldn't that be enough to fix it? i just want to handle this at home if possible.",
